---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../consts';

const title = 'Credentials & Licenses | Dantful Logistics';
const description = 'Dantful Logistics licenses and certifications: NVOCC qualification, Class A customs brokerage, FMC OTI registration, ISO 9001, AEO certified. 17+ years, 80,000+ TEUs shipped from Shenzhen.';

const waNumber = SITE.phone.replace(/[^\d]/g, '');

const breadcrumbJsonLd = JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: '/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About', item: '/about/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'Credentials', item: '/about/credentials/' }
  ]
});

const orgJsonLd = JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Organization',
  name: SITE.name,
  url: '/',
  foundingDate: '2008',
  address: {
    '@type': 'PostalAddress',
    streetAddress: 'Rm 8AB, Wenhua Building East Tower, No.1027 Shennan East Road, Luohu District',
    addressLocality: 'Shenzhen',
    addressRegion: 'Guangdong',
    addressCountry: 'CN'
  },
  telephone: SITE.phone,
  email: SITE.email,
  description: 'NVOCC-licensed freight forwarder based in Shenzhen since 2008. 38,000+ TEUs shipped, 2,400+ active clients in 120+ countries.',
  hasCredential: [
    { '@type': 'EducationalOccupationalCredential', name: 'NVOCC Qualification', credentialCategory: 'China Ministry of Transport' },
    { '@type': 'EducationalOccupationalCredential', name: 'Class A Customs Brokerage License', credentialCategory: 'GACC' },
    { '@type': 'EducationalOccupationalCredential', name: 'ISO 9001 Quality Management', credentialCategory: 'ISO' }
  ]
});

const faqJsonLd = JSON.stringify({
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Is Dantful Logistics a licensed NVOCC?',
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Yes. Dantful Logistics holds NVOCC (Non-Vessel Operating Common Carrier) qualification filed with China Ministry of Transport. This allows us to issue House Bills of Lading, sign direct carrier contracts, and operate as a legal ocean freight forwarder in China.' }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Does Dantful have a US FMC OTI license?',
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Our FMC OTI (Ocean Transportation Intermediary) registration is on file with the US Federal Maritime Commission. This is required for any forwarder handling ocean freight to or from the United States. It allows us to file tariffs, issue HBLs for US-bound cargo, and act as a legal OTI under FMC regulations.' }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What is your customs brokerage license?',
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'We hold a Class A Customs Brokerage License issued by GACC (General Administration of Customs of China). This is the highest tier of customs brokerage in China. We have authorized declarant cards and direct EDI access at 22 major customs districts including Shanghai, Shenzhen, Guangzhou, Qingdao, Tianjin, Ningbo and Xiamen.' }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How long has Dantful been in business?',
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Founded in 2008 in Shenzhen, we have been in operation for 16+ years. In that time we have shipped 38,000+ TEUs of ocean freight and 4,200+ tons of air cargo for 2,400+ active clients in 120+ countries. Our on-time delivery rate is 98.6% and our claims rate is below 0.3%.' }
    }
  ]
});
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <section class="route-hero">
    <div class="route-hero-bg">
      <img src="/images/about-credentials-hero.webp" alt="Dantful Logistics credentials and licenses - NVOCC freight forwarder office in Shenzhen" loading="eager" />
    </div>
    <div class="route-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container route-hero-content">
      <nav class="breadcrumb breadcrumb-light" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/about/">About</a> / <span>Credentials</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Credentials &amp; Licenses</h1>
      <p class="route-hero-sub">Licensed NVOCC freight forwarder since 2008. 80,000+ TEUs shipped, 3,200+ active clients, 98.6% on-time delivery. Below is the full list of qualifications that allow us to move your cargo legally and efficiently from China to 120+ countries.</p>
      <div class="route-hero-cta">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="btn btn-outline">About Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose route-overview">
        <p>Choosing a freight forwarder in China starts with verifying their licenses. An unlicensed forwarder cannot issue House Bills of Lading, file customs declarations, or legally handle international freight. Working with an unlicensed operator risks cargo seizure, fines, and loss of goods. Dantful Logistics holds every qualification required to operate as a full-service NVOCC freight forwarder in China and internationally.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="block-title">Core Licenses &amp; Registrations</h2>
      <div class="cred-grid">
        <div class="cred-card">
          <div class="cred-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 15a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6z"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1-1.51 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 11-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00.33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 110-4h.09a1.65 1.65 0 001.51-1 1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 001.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 114 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 112.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 110 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>NVOCC Qualification</h3>
          <p>Filed with the Ministry of Transport of the People's Republic of China. Authorizes us to issue House Bills of Lading, sign direct carrier contracts, and operate as a legal NVOCC freight forwarder in China.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <div class="cred-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"/><path d="M21 12c0 5-3.5 7.5-8.5 9C7.5 19.5 4 17 4 12V5l8.5-3L21 5v7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Class A Customs Brokerage</h3>
          <p>Issued by the General Administration of Customs of China (GACC). Direct EDI access at 22 major customs districts. 96% of declarations cleared within 4 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <div class="cred-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/><path d="M9 22V12h6v10"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>FMC OTI Registration</h3>
          <p>Registered with the US Federal Maritime Commission (FMC) as an Ocean Transportation Intermediary (OTI). Required for handling ocean freight to/from the United States. Allows us to file tariffs and issue HBLs for US-bound cargo under FMC regulations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <div class="cred-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>ISO 9001 Certified</h3>
          <p>ISO 9001 Quality Management System certified. Covers quote-to-delivery workflow, cargo handling SOPs, and continuous improvement process.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <div class="cred-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>AEO Certified</h3>
          <p>China Customs AEO (Authorized Economic Operator) certified export declaration agent. Enables fast-track clearance and reduced inspection rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <div class="cred-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Member Affiliations</h3>
          <p>Registered member of CIFA (China International Freight Forwarders Association). Overseas partner network audited annually against WCA Family quality standards in 60+ destination countries.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="block-title">Company Track Record</h2>
      <div class="cred-stats">
        <div class="cred-stat">
          <span class="cred-stat-num">16+</span>
          <span class="cred-stat-label">Years in Business</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-stat">
          <span class="cred-stat-num">38,000+</span>
          <span class="cred-stat-label">TEUs Shipped</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-stat">
          <span class="cred-stat-num">2,400+</span>
          <span class="cred-stat-label">Active Clients</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-stat">
          <span class="cred-stat-num">120+</span>
          <span class="cred-stat-label">Countries Served</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-stat">
          <span class="cred-stat-num">98.6%</span>
          <span class="cred-stat-label">On-Time Delivery</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-stat">
          <span class="cred-stat-num">&lt;0.3%</span>
          <span class="cred-stat-label">Claims Rate</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="block-title">Service Capabilities</h2>
      <div class="prose route-overview">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Ocean Freight:</strong> FCL 20GP/40GP/40HQ, LCL consolidation, reefer, OOG/project cargo. Direct carrier contracts with Maersk, MSC, COSCO, ONE, Evergreen, CMA CGM, Hapag-Lloyd. <a href="/services/ocean-freight/">View Ocean Freight service &rarr;</a></li>
          <li><strong>Air Freight:</strong> Express (1-3 days), economy (3-7 days), charter. Block-space agreements with 40+ airlines. <a href="/services/air-freight/">View Air Freight service &rarr;</a></li>
          <li><strong>Amazon FBA:</strong> Sea express, air express, direct courier. FBA prep with FNSKU labeling, poly-bagging, palletization. <a href="/fba/china-to-usa/">View China to USA FBA &rarr;</a></li>
          <li><strong>Customs Clearance:</strong> Class A brokerage, ISF-10/AMS/ENS filing, CO/FORM A/E/F/RCEP. <a href="/services/customs-clearance/">View Customs Clearance &rarr;</a></li>
          <li><strong>Warehousing:</strong> 30,000 sqm bonded warehouse in Shenzhen. Free 30-day storage, consolidation, FBA prep, quality inspection.</li>
          <li><strong>Door-to-Door DDP:</strong> Pre-paid duties, taxes, customs bond, last-mile delivery. Hands-off shipping to USA, EU, UK, Canada, Australia, Japan, Mexico.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="block-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-block">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>Is Dantful Logistics a licensed NVOCC?</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Dantful Logistics holds NVOCC (Non-Vessel Operating Common Carrier) qualification filed with China Ministry of Transport. This allows us to issue House Bills of Lading, sign direct carrier contracts, and operate as a legal ocean freight forwarder in China.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>Does Dantful have a US FMC OTI license?</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Our FMC OTI (Ocean Transportation Intermediary) registration is on file with the US Federal Maritime Commission. This is required for any forwarder handling ocean freight to or from the United States. It allows us to file tariffs, issue HBLs for US-bound cargo, and act as a legal OTI under FMC regulations.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>What is your customs brokerage license?</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>We hold a Class A Customs Brokerage License issued by GACC (General Administration of Customs of China). This is the highest tier of customs brokerage in China. We have authorized declarant cards and direct EDI access at 22 major customs districts including Shanghai, Shenzhen, Guangzhou, Qingdao, Tianjin, Ningbo and Xiamen.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>How long has Dantful been in business?</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Founded in 2008 in Shenzhen, we have been in operation for 16+ years. In that time we have shipped 38,000+ TEUs of ocean freight and 4,200+ tons of air cargo for 2,400+ active clients in 120+ countries. Our on-time delivery rate is 98.6% and our claims rate is below 0.3%.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="route-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="cta-title">Ship with a licensed forwarder</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">Get an all-in quote from a fully licensed NVOCC freight forwarder. No hidden charges, no license risks.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href={`https://wa.me/${waNumber}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">WhatsApp Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={breadcrumbJsonLd} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={orgJsonLd} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={faqJsonLd} />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .route-hero {
    position: relative; min-height: 380px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; color: #fff; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .route-hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }
  .route-hero-bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .route-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(11, 42, 74, 0.92) 0%, rgba(18, 58, 99, 0.85) 50%, rgba(30, 111, 217, 0.78) 100%);
  }
  .route-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-block: 48px; }
  .route-hero-content h1 {
    color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .route-hero-sub {
    color: #e7eff7; font-size: 1rem; max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 0 22px; line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .route-hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .breadcrumb-light { color: #cdd9e6; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .breadcrumb-light a { color: #fff; }
  .route-overview { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .route-overview p, .route-overview ul { color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.75; }
  .route-overview ul { padding-left: 20px; }
  .route-overview li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .route-overview a { color: var(--blue); }
  .block-title {
    color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 36px 0 18px;
    padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--blue);
  }
  .cred-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .cred-card {
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px; transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .cred-card:hover { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(11, 42, 74, 0.08); }
  .cred-icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .cred-icon svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .cred-card h3 { color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .cred-card p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .cred-stats {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .cred-stat {
    background: var(--navy); color: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px 16px; text-align: center;
  }
  .cred-stat-num {
    display: block; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .cred-stat-label {
    display: block; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #cdd9e6;
  }
  .faq-block { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .faq-item {
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 10px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .faq-item[open] { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(11, 42, 74, 0.08); }
  .faq-q {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 20px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;
    font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .faq-q::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-a { padding: 0 20px 18px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.7; }
  .faq-a p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.94rem; }
  .route-cta {
    background: var(--navy); color: #fff; padding-block: 56px; text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-title { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .cta-sub { color: #cdd9e6; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 24px; font-size: 1rem; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .route-cta .btn-outline { border-color: #fff; color: #fff; }
  .route-cta .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .route-hero { min-height: 280px; }
    .cred-grid, .cred-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-buttons { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
  }
</style>
